[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5357612293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122645#issuecomment-5357612293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122645","id":5357612293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP1atBQ","user":{"login":"KrishMaheshwariDev","id":149359722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCOcMag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149359722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev","html_url":"https://github.com/KrishMaheshwariDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KrishMaheshwariDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T14:54:52Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T14:55:17Z","body":"Hi @EdwardChanCH , unfortunatly... I didnt understand the issue.\n\ndo you want the file system naming something like this? \n\nbefore:\n\n- `docks/open_filesystem`\n- `editor/filter_files`\n- `editor/small_deploy_with_network_fs`\n- `filesystem_dock/*`\n- `property_editor/show_in_filesystem`\n- `scene_tree/show_in_file_system`\n- `script_editor/show_in_file_system`\n\nTo:\n\n- `docks/open_filesystem`\n- `editor/filter_filesystem`\n- `editor/small_deploy_with_network_filesystem`\n- `filesystem_dock/*`\n- `property_editor/show_in_filesystem`\n- `scene_tree/show_in_filesystem`\n- `script_editor/show_in_filesystem`\n\nif not, then maybe I didnt understand this issue.\nIf its possible then please explain... I am willing to do a proper research before 5.0","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5357612293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5358898793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122645#issuecomment-5358898793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122645","id":5358898793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP2pOaQ","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T16:40:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T16:40:20Z","body":"Hi @KrishMaheshwariDev,\n\nYeah, you got the spirit.\n\nTechnically, this is somewhat doable (without breaking compatibility) using `EditorSettings::_ha